title: "Causal Separation, Conditional Risk, and Projected Markowitz Portfolios"
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package for the paper "Causal Separation, Conditional Risk,
  and Projected Markowitz Portfolios". Contains the source modules and the
  experiment scripts that regenerate every figure and table in the paper against
  a known data-generating process.
